---
---
<section class="bg-warm-white px-6 py-28 md:py-36">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
    <div class="fade-in-up mb-16 text-center">
      <h2
        class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] font-serif font-normal leading-tight"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
      >
        A room full of people you'd actually want to meet.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Desktop: 2x4 grid, Mobile: horizontal scroll -->
    <div class="hidden md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Founder. Sold her last company. Moved to SF to start something new — and meet someone who gets it."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "ER doctor. Reads more fiction than anyone you know. Tired of apps. Looking for someone curious."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Design lead at a company you've heard of. Makes pottery on weekends. Wants a partner who has strong opinions about dinner."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Investor. Two kids, co-parenting. Not looking for casual — looking for the real thing, round two."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Chef-turned-founder. Built a restaurant group in LA, just moved north. Knows everyone but hasn't found his person."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Writer. Works from cafés. Wants someone who'll actually show up — to the dinner, to the relationship, to life."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Engineer at a frontier AI lab. Brilliant at work, awkward at bars. Looking for context that makes meeting people feel natural."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in-up rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Art advisor. Splits time between SF and New York. Wants a social life that doesn't feel like networking."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile: horizontal scroll -->
    <div class="flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto pb-4 md:hidden" style="-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; scrollbar-width: none;">
      <div class="min-w-[280px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-cream p-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-base italic text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          "Founder. Sold her last company. Moved to SF to start something new — and meet someone who gets it."
